---
/**
 * "lado a / lado b" music teaser block — ported from
 * reference/home-mockup-reference.html. No real song audio (Mission 01
 * scope-out); "poner play" routes to the lado-a-lado-b stub, it doesn't
 * play anything.
 */
---

<section class="block">
  <div class="music-teaser">
    <div class="reel-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 72 72" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="36" cy="36" r="36" fill="var(--retro-pop)" />
        <circle cx="36" cy="36" r="27" fill="var(--polaroid-sunset)" />
        <circle cx="36" cy="36" r="18" fill="var(--view-master)" />
        <circle cx="36" cy="36" r="9" fill="var(--vintage-sky)" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="music-teaser-text">
      <p class="eyebrow">lado a / lado b</p>
      <h3>nuestras canciones, como siempre debieron escucharse.</h3>
      <p>El reproductor completo, sin distribuidoras de por medio.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-outline-cream" href="/lado-a-lado-b">poner play</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .block {
    max-width: 68.75rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1rem;
  }

  .music-teaser {
    background: var(--brown-tape);
    color: var(--vintage-sky);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .reel-icon {
    width: 4.5rem;
    height: 4.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .reel-icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .music-teaser-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 13.75rem;
  }

  .music-teaser-text .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--polaroid-sunset);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .music-teaser-text h3 {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--vintage-sky);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .music-teaser-text p:not(.eyebrow) {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
    max-width: 23.75rem;
  }

  .btn-outline-cream {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    padding: 0.8125rem 1.625rem;
    display: inline-block;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 2px;
    border: 2px solid var(--vintage-sky);
    color: var(--vintage-sky);
    background: transparent;
  }

  .btn-outline-cream:hover {
    background: var(--vintage-sky);
    color: var(--brown-tape);
  }
</style>
